Package: org.dayuzou.airtuneshall-disable
Name: Disable AirTunesHAL (iOS 6)
Version: 1.0.1
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: Reversibly disables AirTunesHAL by renaming its plugin directory. This removes AirPlay output support and requires a reboot. Removing this package attempts to restore the original plugin directory.
Maintainer: Dayu Zou
Author: Dayu Zou
Section: System
Priority: optional
Depends: firmware (>= 6.0), firmware (<< 7.0)
